    "updated_at": "2021-07-17T03:11:00Z",
    "body": "It seems to be an issue specific to zsh, due to the shell using `%` as an escape character.\r\nTesting it on my end, the issue isn't reproduced in Fish or Bash.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"400\" alt=\"CleanShot 2021-07-16 at 23 06 39@2x\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4658208/126023502-c544dc49-e743-4676-b0e7-1cb8871b6e2e.png\">\r\n\r\nMy hunch is that we need to escape percent signs with backslashes in zsh: `\\%`",
