    "created_at": "2021-08-14T15:32:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-14T15:32:21Z",
    "body": "The actual escape sequence to use is `%%` ([ref](https://zsh.sourceforge.io/Doc/Release/Prompt-Expansion.html)).  I hit a variant of this myself when trying to set the `character` prompt component to a percent sign.  A trailing `{`appeared in the prompt, because the lone percent sign interfered with other escape sequence processing.  Setting `success_character` (and `error_character`) to the string `%%` fixed the issue, but probably starship ought to handle this internally.",
